# Source for `pnpm generate:api`. Optional — defaults to the committed
# packages/api-client/openapi.json (Swagger is disabled in production).
#
# To point at a live spec instead:
# OPENAPI_URL=https://<backend>/api/docs-json
#
# To regenerate openapi.json from the backend (Swagger is prod-guarded), run in
# the bravachain-api repo:
#   npx ts-node -r tsconfig-paths/register scripts/generate-openapi.ts
# then copy openapi/openapi.json to packages/api-client/openapi.json.
